OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry clear
OL,6,Fevening. Dry and settled overnight
OL,7,Fwith light winds and largely clear
OL,8,Fskies. Turning cold again, with frost
OL,9,Fdeveloping in places along with a few
OL,10,Ffog patches.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FAnother cold start with frost
OL,13,Fin places and any fog patches quickly
OL,14,Fclearing. Remaining dry and settled
OL,15,Fduring the day with plenty of sunshine
OL,16,Fand light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
